        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a well-circumscribed lesion; a grenz zone; patternless architecture; finely collagenous stroma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:22:20"
      }
    ],
